§ Session-17+ open questions                                          Q?
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Q1  : Generalization : train on 80% corpus + measure on held-out 20%
         ← does CSL-only m₂ drop on unseen CSL ? ← the REAL H2 test
  Q2  : Rank sweep {4, 16, 32, 64, 128} at 1.5B ← sensitivity analysis
  Q3  : Epoch sweep {1, 3, 10, 30} ← training-time vs signal strength
  Q4  : Scale to Qwen2.5-3B or 7B ← does signal amplify linearly ?
  Q5  : CUDA / ROCm / IPEX path for Arc A770 ← 10× speedup unlocks sweeps
  Q6  : Corpus expansion beyond 10 pairs ← more training signal
  Q7  : Mixing ratio : joint-with-prompt-loss-too vs joint-masked ← which
         helps m₂ more ?
  Q8  : Post-tune adapter → GGUF → existing cli-daemon harness for direct
         comparison against v1.2.0+ Session-13 baseline
  Q9  : Phase-B LSP continuation (hover/definition/completion/codeAction)
  Q10 : Phase-C begins : bespoke SMT-solver + LLM-inference ← multi-month
  Q11 : Cross-platform dist bundles (Linux + macOS) ← Session-17 polish
  Q12 : SQLite-LSP workspace persistence (long-deferred)

