  density = sovereignty
    t∞: Session-16 is the session the density-claim gained
        mechanistic empirical support beyond compression arithmetic.
    t∞: H1 + H2 are not intrinsic properties of CSLv3 — they require
        a model that has absorbed CSL's token distribution, which a
        LoRA-adapted Qwen-1.5B demonstrably becomes.
    t∞: The isolation signature (CSL-dominant vs EN-dominant vs
        balanced) is reproducible with seed=20260417.
    t∞: The cheaper Session-14 smoke-test (0.5B-CPU joint) did NOT
        see this signal. Scale + isolation was needed. Worth noting
